            "dimensions": {
              "originalWidth": 1680,
              "originalHeight": 945
            }
          },
          "body_html": "<p>Understanding the physical mechanisms of <strong>optical switching</strong> is only the foundation. The true test of any <strong>networking architecture</strong> is how it performs under the extreme stress of <strong>hyperscale production</strong>.</p><p>Modern <strong>AI data centers</strong> can no longer rely on theoretical advantages. They require concrete, measurable improvements in <strong>power efficiency</strong>, <strong>bandwidth availability</strong>, and <strong>fault tolerance</strong>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "text",
          "variant": "subheading",
          "style": {
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 0,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "heading_html": "<p><strong>By the end of this module, you should be able to:</strong></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "list",
          "variant": "bulleted",
          "style": {
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "list_style": "bulleted",
          "items_html": [
            "<p>Describe three production-proven OCS deployment patterns in hyperscale AI data centers.</p>",
            "<p>Identify the architectural mechanism behind EPS spine replacement, dynamic cluster reconfiguration, and hardware failure resiliency.</p>",
            "<p>Articulate the concrete power, performance, and efficiency benefits achieved in each deployment.</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "type": "quote",
          "variant": "d",
          "style": {
            "background_type": "LIGHT",
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "quote_html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 2.1rem\"><em>We want to extend our recognition to </em><strong><em>Ajay Gautham Manicka, Optical Transport Engineer</em></strong><em> at </em><strong><em>Nebius</em></strong><em>. His technical guidance was key during the design and development of this course.</em></span></p>",
          "avatar": {
