            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "body_html": "<p>Static diagrams cannot fully capture the dynamic nature of a <strong>programmable AI cluster</strong>.</p><p>The following video deconstructs the <strong>TPUv4 Superpod architecture</strong>, demonstrating exactly how a <strong>software control plane</strong> manipulates <strong>X</strong>, <strong>Y</strong>, and <strong>Z</strong> optical switches to physically reshape the <strong>network topology</strong> in real time.</p>"
