          "heading_html": "<p><strong>Visualizing the physical mirror adjustments provides the mechanical context for dynamic routing. However, the true value of this architecture lies in its </strong><span style=\"color: #8cc53f; text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"inner\"><strong>operational impact</strong></span><strong>.</strong></p>"
