            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "body_html": "<p>Congratulations! You have successfully completed this course.</p><p>As you move forward, consider how these concepts can be applied in real-world scenarios to enhance efficiency and performance:</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "list",
          "variant": "bulleted",
          "style": {
            "background_type": "COLOR",
            "background_color": "#1c1c1c",
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "list_style": "bulleted",
          "items_html": [
            "<p>Replacing EPS spine switches with OCS reduces power consumption by up to 41 percent and Capex by 30 percent while enabling rate-independent upgrades.</p>",
            "<p>Google TPUv4 Superpods use 48 MEMS OCS switches to dynamically interlink 64 Cubes, creating optimized 3D torus topologies matched to specific workloads.</p>",
            "<p>OCS transforms the network into an active resiliency platform, using physical-layer reconfiguration to completely bypass failed hardware and restore full bandwidth.</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "text",
          "variant": "subheading",
          "style": {
            "background_type": "COLOR",
            "background_color": "#1c1c1c",
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 0,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "heading_html": "<p>Next up,&nbsp;we will explore emerging frontier applications like <span style=\"color: #8cc53f; text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"inner\">Mixture-of-Experts training</span>, dynamic <span style=\"color: #8cc53f; text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"inner\">in-workload reconfiguration</span>, and <span style=\"color: #8cc53f; text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"inner\">quantum networking</span>.</p>"
        },
